# A committed TEMPLATE of .github/c2-serving-job.env for the tp4/drafter-arms four-card window (scripts/ci/c2_serving_job.py parses it): copy it over
# .github/c2-serving-job.env on a throwaway commit of the integrated branch and push a tag experiment/c2-serving-vN. Nothing here names a rig, a card, a host or a
# registry: the cards are resolved at run time. The jobs are templates only: no tag is pushed from the branch that holds them.
# THREE IMAGES: tp4-drafter-1 (the default drafter manifest, dedf8df6: the control arm and the bf16 arm), tp4-drafter-b16-1 (the block-16 candidate manifest, b16-98759a49) and tp4-drafter-b32-1 (the block-32
# candidate manifest, b32-fc65843b: MEASUREMENT ONLY). All are built by the integration step from the same commit, the candidates with C2_DRAFTER_MANIFEST (B1, B2); the candidates' fixtures are staged on the build host first (drafter_stage.py stage).
# A tag that already exists is skipped by the build step: the tags must be fresh. The cards are under development: this window never stops, starts or hands back the node agent.
# B2 (no card opened): build the candidate image tp4-drafter-b32-1 from the SAME commit with C2_DRAFTER_MANIFEST=b32-fc65843b: the build lays the DRAFTER_MANIFEST marker beside the fixtures, takes the
# config from the candidate repository at its pinned revision and refuses a config whose sha256 is not the manifest's. Needs the candidate's fixtures staged under the build host's
# fixture cache first (python3 scripts/ci/drafter_stage.py stage --checkpoint <the downloaded file> --manifest b32-fc65843b --cache <the fixture cache>; it verifies every tensor).
# READ: provenance report with no problem line, the image id printed. Duration (estimate): 60 min. Kill rule: a build or provenance failure skips the b32 job (D-T4). The b32 image is for the tau lab only: its licence is a hub metadata field with no LICENSE file, so it is never pushed and no qualification follows it.
C2_CARDS=quad
C2_ACTIONS=build
C2_IMAGE_TAG=tp4-drafter-b32-1
C2_PROFILE=c2-packed-tp4
C2_DRAFTER_MANIFEST=b32-fc65843b
